    "2026-09-24: every field value re-read at full resolution (upright 300 dpi crops), not the preview. Corrected: p10 nomor_cpo and p12 purchase_order_no 58423525 -> 58423526 (page 16's PO is 58423525; two Hero bundles had been mixed up). Removed: p2 no_receive, first two characters illegible. Added verified: p9 PO, p16 PO, NO GRN on p19/22/25/28/31. The corrections were prompted by an AI OCR disagreement but decided only from the pixels.",
