    "2026-09-25 (phase 7): customer documents extended by eye at full resolution. Header: TTG posting_date (the receipt date: Tgl Terima / GR Date / TGL KONFIRMASI GRN, not TGL PO) and vendor_number; PO ppn, vendor_code, purchase_order_no and total. PO total means the total INCLUDING tax (Boots 'Total Include Tax', Hero 'TOTAL NETTO'), the amount an FP total is compared with; null = checked by eye and not printed on the page (Hero pages 18, 24 and 27 end before TOTAL NETTO; 24 and 27 before PPN too), so any stored value is wrong. 'amounts': every printed amount with its label. 'lines': every row of every PO/TTG in pages 1-31. qty is the quantity column as printed (TTG: received; Hari Hari 'Diterima Case', Hero 'JUMLAH DITERIMA'), 'also' = the same quantity printed in another quantity column (a Hero PO's JUMLAH SATUAN in eaches), pack = pieces per carton, pcs = the quantity in pieces. The pack size is never a quantity, even where one carton holds as many (Hari Hari's '40.00 PC'; decided 2026-09-25). Bonus rows (price 0) are flagged; code null = illegible. FP values (header and lines) are graded against Satellite's SO record, not here: 'fp_amounts_edge' marks the FP amounts the scan's right edge cut (print can't back them in full); 'fp_amounts_faint' page 8's faint print."
